"id":"euler.lemma-2.2","kind":"claim","label":"Lemma 2.2","locator":"Lemma 2.2, Section 2","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Lemma 2.2.** Let $B(t)$ be a smooth trace-free matrix, and let $k\\ne0$ and $\\mathbf a\\ne0$ satisfy (2.1) with $D$ replaced by $B$. Put $E_1=\\frac{k}{|k|}$, $E_2=\\frac{\\mathbf a}{|\\mathbf a|}$ and $E_3=E_1\\times E_2$, write $B_{ij}=E_i\\cdot BE_j$ $(i,j=1,2,3)$ for the entries of $B$ in this orthonormal frame, and let $\\sigma=|k|\\,|\\mathbf a|$, $\\nu=B_{12}$ and $\\eta=B_{32}$. Then $$\\begin{equation}\n E_1'=-\\nu E_2-B_{13}E_3,\\quad\n E_2'=\\nu E_1-\\eta E_3,\\quad\n E_3'=B_{13}E_1+\\eta E_2,\n \\qquad(\\log\\sigma)'=B_{33}. \\tag{2.2}\n\\end{equation}$$","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-2.2","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-2.2","id":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-2.2%22%2C%22lean.TorusEuler.Paper.lemma_2_2%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-2.2%22%2C%22lean.TorusEuler.Paper.lemma_2_2%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/lean.TorusEuler.Paper.lemma_2_2"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-2.3","id":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-2.3%22%2C%22euler.lemma-2.2%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-2.3%22%2C%22euler.lemma-2.2%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semant